Build against zxing-cpp v3.

BarcodeScannerView 1.6.5 is the newest release and still pins zxing-cpp v2.3.0.4.
We bump zxing-cpp ourselves for the newer scanning code and to
get onto a toolchain that matches p4a's.

The version here must match ZXING_CPP_VERSION in make_barcode_scanner.sh

diff --git a/barcodescannerview/build.gradle b/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
index bd26c96..29eefd8 100644
--- a/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
+++ b/barcodescannerview/build.gradle
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ android {

 	dependencies {
-		api 'com.github.markusfisch:CameraView:1.10.0'
-		api 'com.github.markusfisch:zxing-cpp:v2.3.0.4'
+		api 'com.github.markusfisch:CameraView:1.10.2'
+		api 'com.github.markusfisch:zxing-cpp:v3.1.0.0'
 	}
 }

